# Longest Consecutive Sequence

Approach

Step 1
Store all elements in unordered_set.

Step 2
Traverse each element in the set.

Step 3
If (num - 1) is not present, then num is the start of a sequence.

Step 4
Keep checking num + 1, num + 2, ... until the sequence ends.

Step 5
Update the maximum length.

Time Complexity
O(n)

Space Complexity
O(n)